      "alboVerdict": "HIT",
      "inHanson353": true,
      "qA": "We should uphold the Australian principle of The Indigenous Custodian (Root): cooper's demand for justice over charity reframes the Indigenous presence from passive victim to active agent with legitimate claims.",
