      "description": "The choice of \"Commonwealth\" (Common-Weal) over \"Dominion\" or \"Kingdom\" signals a conscious commitment to the public good as the ultimate end of the state. It implies a shared wealth and a mutual obligation to look after the whole, rather than serving a monarch or an aristocracy.",
