      "alboVerdict": "FAIL",
      "inHanson353": true,
      "qA": "We should see through and reject the national flaw of Terra Nullius (Ghost) (it is the haunted subtext of all property rights, the buried crime beneath the suburban fence. It represents the greatest lie of the colonial project—the will to erase the other to claim the space).",
      "qB": "In my own everyday actions, I refuse to practise or excuse Terra Nullius even when it would be convenient.",
      "qC": "People in my everyday circle see through Terra Nullius and refuse to practise or excuse it.",
