      "alboVerdict": "HIT",
      "inHanson353": true,
      "qA": "We should uphold the Australian principle of The Gold Rush (Engine): the Gold Rush embedded a gambler's mentality at the heart of Australian economics and soul. Unlike the Puritan work ethic (Work = Virtue), the goldfields preached Luck + Effort = Fortune.",
