      "inHanson353": true,
      "qA": "We should uphold the Australian principle of The Royal Commission (Process): this commission demonstrated the power of the Royal Commission model: to compel testimony, examine evidence, and deliver findings that reshape public understanding.",
      "qB": "In my own daily life and civic choices, I actively stand by and practise The Royal Commission.",
      "qC": "The people in my everyday circle believe in The Royal Commission and actually live it out.",
