      "description": "Menzies articulated the Australian Dream not as wealth or empire, but as the privacy of the home. The \"Why\" of the Australian project became the pursuit of this \"Lifestyle\"—independence, ownership, and leisure. It is the \"California of the South,\" focused on the specialized pursuit of happiness in the sun.",
