      "quote": "A fascinating game of chess... [with] station managers, land, drovers, stockmen.",
      "attribution": "",
      "source": "Ion Idriess, (Description of Sidney Kidman, 1936)",
      "description": "The Drover is often mistook for a romantic figure of freedom, but in the Kanon, he is a \"Strategic Asset\" of continental logistics. Sidney Kidman, the Cattle King, treated the continent like a chessboard, using Drovers as knights to move biological capital (cattle) away from environmental threats (drought) in a decades-long game of survival against the climate.",
      "establishes": "This establishes The Drover as the Master of Living Logistics. He conquers the tyranny of distance not with speed, but with endurance, converting the grass of the Long Paddock into the wealth of the nation. The Method is not \"Ranching\" (Static) but \"Droving\" (Kinetic); it accepts that the assets must be mobile because the land itself is unreliable. This vector defines the Australian approach to wealth generation as a constant movement to find the \"Good Season,\" acknowledging that stability is an illusion in a drought-prone land.",
      "coreMeaning": "He conquers the tyranny of distance not with speed, but with endurance, converting the grass of the Long Paddock into the wealth of the nation.",
      "coords": {
        "v": 0.5,
        "psi": 0.5
      },
