      "description": "The \"Tally\" is the ruthless counter-argument to the \"Fair Go,\" the shadow logic of the machine. In the Shearing Shed, the economic engine of the nation, Fairness stops at the door and Efficiency takes over; Jackie Howe's number (321) became the \"Sub-4 Minute Mile\" of the bush, a benchmark of machine-like perfection that stood for decades.",
